  "description": "Entity Framework Core provider for SharpCoreDB encrypted database engine. Built for .NET 11 with C# 15. Supports Windows, Linux, macOS, Android, iOS, and IoT/embedded devices with platform-specific optimizations. Compatible with SharpCoreDB 2.1.2.",
